  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use the elemental air suffusing your body to purify the air around you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Inner Breath<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +2 racial bonus on saving throws against inhaled poisons and cloud, gas, or mist attacks (such as cloudkill). If you spend one use of your mythic power you can, as a full-round action that draws attacks of opportunity, expel elemental air from your body to end the effects of any inhaled poison, cloud, mist, or gas affecting you or an adjacent ally. If you are the area of such an effect when you use this ability, you can instead choose to dispel and disperse a 10-foot cube of such cloud, gas, or mist for every two mythic tiers you possess (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc52\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
